__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The Artifact Registry's built index is a derived, disposable view
# over AOS/output/ (see AOS/artifact-registry/artifact-registry-model.md)
# — rebuild with `python3 AOS/artifact-registry/runtime/registry_builder.py`.
# Not yet wired into the daily orchestrator run, so committing today's
# manually-built copy would misrepresent it as real scheduled output.
AOS/artifact-registry/runtime/index/*.json

# Real connector credentials — copy AOS/opportunity-hunter/runtime/config/
# credentials.template.env to .env locally and fill in real values there;
# never commit the filled-in file. Production uses GitHub Actions secrets.
.env
